      NLB(`returnService;serviceName) }

Note that in the `execRequest` function, `nh` is the asynchronous handle to the gateway.

Calling `nh[]` after sending the result causes the outgoing message queue for this handle to be flushed immediately. Basics: [Interprocess communications](../../basics/ipc/)

